        <body>
            <div xml:id="d581">

                <pb facs="1009" n="913" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg913"/>

                <head>No. 579.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Cushing to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-09-22"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 22,
                        1874</date>. (Received October 17.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 104.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose herewith original and translation
                    of a communication addressed by Admiral Polo de Bernabé to the newspaper
                    published in this city entitled “El Gobierno,” in which he emphatically declares
                    the forgery and falsehood of the correspondence on the subject of Puerto Rico
                    attributed to him by the “Freeman’s Journal,” of New York.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.</p>
                <closer><signed>C. CUSHING.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d581-a1.xml" xpointer="d581-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
